<title>JAPAN: Elna - 1996 group results.</title>
<headline>Elna - 1996 group results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 31.79		vs	   29.73</p>
<p> Operating	  527 million	 vs	    1.05</p>
<p> Current     loss 151 million	 vs	prft 384 million</p>
<p> Net	   loss 583 million	 vs	prft 315 million</p>
<p> EPS	    loss 21.93 yen	  vs    prft 11.86 yen</p>
<p> Diluted EPS	     -		vs		 -</p>
<p>NOTE - Elna Co Ltd is a medium-standing maker of aluminium electrolytic capacitors and printed circuit boards.</p>
